#NEXUS

[ mcdonald2018b_fig12: Tyrannosauroid strict consensus, 34 tips. Polytomies: Tyrannosauroidea (Proceratosauridae, Aviatyrannis, the rest), Eotyrannus + Juratyrant + Stokesosaurus, and an eight-way node of tyrannosaurines. Numbers at nodes are Bremer support. Random-sample case (seed 20261106). Topology transcribed from the figure and checked node by node; topology only. ]

